---
import { withBase } from "../utils/paths";
---
<section class="advisory-section section-pad">
  <div class="container advisory-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Selective advisory</p>
      <h2>Complex technology problems benefit from clear architecture.</h2>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p>I’m open to selective advisory and consulting opportunities where I can help organizations solve complex technology problems, shape platform strategy, modernize critical systems, and apply AI responsibly. I’m especially interested in situations where hands-on technical depth, architecture leadership, and cross-team alignment can create disproportionate impact.</p>
      <div class="focus-line"><span>Focus areas</span><strong>Platform architecture · modernization · distributed systems · decisioning · applied AI · engineering transformation</strong></div>
      <a class="button button-dark" href={withBase("/contact")}>Discuss an advisory opportunity <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
